  <entry>
    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/1506.05734v1</id>
    <title>Orthogonal polynomials for the weakly equilibrium Cantor sets</title>
    <updated>2015-06-18T16:07:15Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1506.05734v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/1506.05734v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>Let $K(γ)$ be the weakly equilibrium Cantor type set introduced in [10]. It is proven that the monic orthogonal polynomials $Q_{2^s}$ with respect to the equilibrium measure of $K(γ)$ coincide with the Chebyshev polynomials of the set. Procedures are suggested to find $Q_{n}$ of all degrees and the corresponding Jacobi parameters. It is shown that the sequence of the Widom factors is bounded below.</summary>
    <category term="math.SP" scheme="http://arxiv.org/schemas/atom"/>
