  <entry>
    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/1503.07098v4</id>
    <title>Orthogonal polynomials on generalized Julia sets</title>
    <updated>2016-06-06T23:33:44Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.07098v4" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/1503.07098v4" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>We extend results by Barnsley et al. about orthogonal polynomials on Julia sets to the case of generalized Julia sets. The equilibrium measure is considered. In addition, we discuss optimal smoothness of Green functions and Parreau-Widom criterion for a special family of real generalized Julia sets.</summary>
    <category term="math.DS" scheme="http://arxiv.org/schemas/atom"/>
    <published>2015-03-24T16:20:41Z</published>
